<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Mutual.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Mutual.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Washington Mutual Inc and added the stock to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Washington Mutual gained 5/8 to 63-3/4.</p>
